        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, as part of our transition to a SaaS-driven business model, we are directing capital and operating investment toward SaaS product development and go-to-market execution while deliberately limiting incremental investment in Marketing Services.",
        "start_character": 21048,
        "end_character": 21303
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001556739-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001556739-26-000013-98ea985bce930811",
        "accession_number": "0001556739-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "During the year ended December 31, 2024, we made a strategic decision to terminate our Marketing Services offerings by the end of 2028.",
        "start_character": 10832,
        "end_character": 10967
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001556739-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001556739-26-000013-98ea985bce930811",
        "accession_number": "0001556739-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the foregoing, we have established business procedures designed to maintain the confidentiality of our proprietary information, including the use of confidentiality agreements and assignment of inventions agreements with employees, independent contractors, consultants, and companies with which we conduct business.",
        "start_character": 34974,
        "end_character": 35304
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001556739-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001556739-26-000013-98ea985bce930811",
        "accession_number": "0001556739-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we integrate with select third-party vendors who are managed by our in-house product and development teams.",
        "start_character": 36067,
        "end_character": 36187
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001556739-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001556739-26-000013-98ea985bce930811",
        "accession_number": "0001556739-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our Marketing Services business, we compete with numerous national companies that sell marketing campaigns on major national search engines and social media sites and build and host websites.",
        "start_character": 25378,
        "end_character": 25572
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001556739-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001556739-26-000013-98ea985bce930811",
        "accession_number": "0001556739-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are continuing to transition clients with these Digital marketing services products to our SaaS Platform offerings.",
        "start_character": 13507,
        "end_character": 13625
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001556739-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001556739-26-000013-98ea985bce930811",
        "accession_number": "0001556739-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are prioritizing product development and platform unification efforts that deepen integration across CRM, automation, marketing, communications, payments, and reporting.",
        "start_character": 18377,
        "end_character": 18549
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001556739-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001556739-26-000013-98ea985bce930811",
        "accession_number": "0001556739-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to manage our Marketing Services offerings, some of which are in secular decline, notably Print, to maximize profitability and extend the life of these solutions through the end of 2028.",
        "start_character": 20010,
        "end_character": 20208
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001556739-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001556739-26-000013-98ea985bce930811",
        "accession_number": "0001556739-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer implementation, training, and consulting services to help customers maximize value from our platform, including onboarding and implementation, a year-one Customer Success Manager, and Thryv Success Services which includes listing refresh services, strategic content creation, and ongoing strategic consulting.",
        "start_character": 9707,
        "end_character": 10025
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001556739-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001556739-26-000013-98ea985bce930811",
        "accession_number": "0001556739-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We possess certain intellectual property relating to Thryv®, Thryv Leads®, and our Marketing Services offerings, including but not limited to the following:",
        "start_character": 33992,
        "end_character": 34148
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001556739-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001556739-26-000013-98ea985bce930811",
        "accession_number": "0001556739-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2025, we augmented the Thryv Platform with Keap Automations, which were developed by Keap.",
        "start_character": 35973,
        "end_character": 36066
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001556739-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001556739-26-000013-98ea985bce930811",
        "accession_number": "0001556739-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The Company offers a platform for our employees to communicate with leadership – to share insights, generate ideas, and drive actions that promote inclusion at Thryv.",
